IMPORT prelude

-- Charities Act 2013 (Cth). Source: ../registers/source-bundle/C2013A00100.txt.
-- Seat: the entity asking whether it is a charity.

§ `Nouns`

DECLARE `Kind of entity` IS ONE OF
    `an organisation`
    `an individual`
    `a political party`
    `a government entity`

-- s 12(1), with the s 7 presumed purposes picked out.
DECLARE `Kind of purpose` IS ONE OF
    -- s 7 presumed
    `preventing or relieving sickness, disease or human suffering`
    `advancing education`
    `relieving poverty, distress or disadvantage`
    `caring for the aged or individuals with disabilities`
    `advancing religion`
    -- s 8
    `relieving necessitous circumstances of individuals in Australia`
    -- the other s 12(1) purposes, including (l)
    `another charitable purpose under s 12(1)`
    -- s 5(b)(ii)
    `incidental or ancillary to a charitable purpose`
    -- s 11
    `a disqualifying purpose`
    `a purpose that is none of these`

DECLARE `Purpose` HAS
    `kind`                                              IS A `Kind of purpose`
    -- s 6(1): a finding (both limbs)
    `found to be for the public benefit`                IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s 6(1)(a): the achievement of the purpose would be of public benefit
    `achievement would be of public benefit`            IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s 7: evidence to the contrary
    `evidence to the contrary`                          IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Entity` HAS
    `kind`                                              IS A `Kind of entity`
    `not-for-profit`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    -- s 10(1)-(2)
    `an open self-help group or contemplative order under s 10` IS A BOOLEAN
    `purposes`                                          IS A LIST OF `Purpose`

§ `Rules`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `presumed under s 7` k IF
        k EQUALS `preventing or relieving sickness, disease or human suffering`
    OR  k EQUALS `advancing education`
    OR  k EQUALS `relieving poverty, distress or disadvantage`
    OR  k EQUALS `caring for the aged or individuals with disabilities`
    OR  k EQUALS `advancing religion`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a charitable purpose` k IF
        `presumed under s 7` k
    OR  k EQUALS `relieving necessitous circumstances of individuals in Australia`
    OR  k EQUALS `another charitable purpose under s 12(1)`

-- ss 6-8, 10: whether a charitable purpose meets the public benefit test.
@ref ss 6-8, 10
GIVEN p IS A `Purpose`, e IS A `Entity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the public benefit test` p `for` e IF
        e's `an open self-help group or contemplative order under s 10`
    OR  p's `found to be for the public benefit`
    OR  (`presumed under s 7` (p's `kind`) AND NOT (p's `evidence to the contrary`))
    OR  (p's `kind` EQUALS `relieving necessitous circumstances of individuals in Australia` AND p's `achievement would be of public benefit`)

-- s 5(b)-(c): each purpose qualifies.
@ref s 5(b)-(c)
GIVEN p IS A `Purpose`, e IS A `Entity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the purpose qualifies` p `for` e IF
        (`a charitable purpose` (p's `kind`) AND `meets the public benefit test` p `for` e)
    OR  p's `kind` EQUALS `incidental or ancillary to a charitable purpose`

@ref ss 5-12
@export default Are we a charity under the Charities Act 2013 (Cth)? An entity is a charity if it is not-for-profit; all of its purposes are charitable purposes (s 12) for the public benefit (ss 6-10: found, or presumed under s 7 absent evidence to the contrary, or not required for self-help groups and contemplative orders), or incidental or ancillary to such purposes; none is a disqualifying purpose (s 11); and it is not an individual, a political party or a government entity (s 5). It must have at least one charitable purpose. DRAFT, not reviewed by an Australian lawyer.
GIVEN e IS A `Entity`  @desc The kind of entity, whether not-for-profit, any s 10 status, and its purposes
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `we are a charity` e IF
        e's `kind` EQUALS `an organisation`
    AND e's `not-for-profit`
    AND any (GIVEN p YIELD `a charitable purpose` (p's `kind`)) (e's `purposes`)
    AND all (GIVEN p YIELD `the purpose qualifies` p `for` e) (e's `purposes`)
